# Come and Play

It starts today at 5.30pm. A brand new African drumming course for beginners. Learn traditional West African drumming with Nathaniel Combs on African djembe and dundun. All courses run for 5 weeks and cost $99. You are welcome to bring your own drum or hire one for $4. There are also drums to purchase at the classes. Drummers are also welcome to stay and drum for the dance class at 6.30pm. All drummers will receive a weekly youtube video covering the main rhythm that was taught in the class. All drummers can dance for $10. Purchase your 5 week course [here](/product/5-drumming-classes-sunshine-coast/).
